# Local-only overrides
# NOTE: build.sh, run.sh, build-android.sh, sync-gamefiles.sh and lib.sh are deliberately NOT ignored.
# `*.sh` used to be ignored here, which left the entire build tooling unversioned - unrecoverable on a
# re-clone and invisible to anyone else working on the project.
loader/Desktop-app-local.xml
# Kept ignored as a safety net: gamefiles now sync to build/gamefiles-upstream/. This directory is
# only a legacy fallback for checkouts predating that move and should not exist.
loader/gamefiles/
aqwpocket_keystore_local.p12


# Local SWC builds
loader/libs/AqwApi.swc
loader/libs/ModUI.swc

# Stray editor/merge backups
*.bak
*.bak*
*.orig
*.rej
